00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.680
success.

00:12:54.218 --> 00:12:57.080
>> [music]

00:12:54.680 --> 00:13:00.000
>> Now, sure, in the end it all worked out

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:01.720
fabulously, but I can tell you this

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:04.440
much.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:07.960
The mind does get built over time

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:10.594
because our mind is not fixed as a

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.640
photograph. It's a sculpture.

00:13:10.594 --> 00:13:13.600
>> [music]

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:15.640
>> You can shape it, strengthen it one

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:19.109
