00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.720
In the year 1500, there was a single

00:13:19.109 --> 00:13:22.880
[music]

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:25.720
rejected block of marble.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:27.800
It was sitting there, abandoned, ignored

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:31.320
